---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
description: Kyle Hubbard is a Solutions Architect on TrendAI's Global Alliances team, working on the AWS partnership and AI security.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="mono-label hero__eyebrow">TrendAI Global Alliances &middot; Denver, Colorado</p>
    <h1 class="hero__title">
      The bridge between the technically minded
      <span class="hero__title-b">and the business focused.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero__lede">
      I'm Kyle Hubbard, a Solutions Architect on TrendAI's Global Alliances team. I'm on the
      technical side of our AWS partnership, and most of my time right now goes to AI
      security, specifically how customers keep control of AI agents once they're running in
      production.
    </p>
    <p class="hero__actions">
      <a class="btn" href="/partnerships/">Partnership work</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/resume/">Resume</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--ruled">
  <div class="wrap band__grid">
    <div class="rail">
      <p class="mono-label">What I<br />work on</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="lede band__lede">
        Most of my work falls into four areas.
      </p>

      <div class="scopelist">
        {% for item in scope %}
        <div class="scope">
          <p class="mono-label scope__label">{{ item.label }}</p>
          <p class="scope__text">{{ item.text }}</p>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--ruled band--tint">
  <div class="wrap band__grid">
    <div class="rail">
      <p class="mono-label">Two ways<br />to say it</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="lede band__lede">
        A lot of my job is explaining the same work to two different audiences. A few
        examples:
      </p>

      <div class="registers">
        {% for item in highlights %}
        <div class="register">
          <p class="mono-label register__topic">{{ item.topic }}</p>
          <div class="register__side">
            <p class="mono-label register__label">{{ item.left.label }}</p>
            <p class="register__text">{{ item.left.text }}</p>
          </div>
          <div class="register__side register__side--b">
            <p class="mono-label register__label">{{ item.right.label }}</p>
            <p class="register__text">{{ item.right.text }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--ruled">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="closer__line">
      Working on something with AWS or TrendAI? I would love to hear about it.
    </p>
    <p class="hero__actions">
      <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/about/">More about me</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
